      "content": "hey im feeling really weird all of a sudden. i'm super shaky and sweating a lot and kinda feel lightheaded/confused. my blood sugar was actually a bit high like an hour ago so i think maybe it's finally dropping but im still feeling off. should i just take an extra unit of my rapid insulin to keep it steady so it doesnt spike again?",
